# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# NOTE: capacitor.config.json, config.xml, and App/App/public are intentionally
# NOT ignored. The Xcode project references them as bundle resources, so keeping
# them tracked lets a fresh clone open & build in Xcode without first running
# `npx cap sync ios`. They are regenerated by `cap sync` from the root
# capacitor.config.json and capacitor/www — re-run sync and commit if they drift.
